{
  "id": 91108463,
  "iid": 2301,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "MP2T: Detect stuffing bytes after SECTs when PUSI is 0",
  "description": "When the payload_unit_start_indicator is 0, a continued section may be\nfollowed by stuffing bytes. Detect the stuffing bytes based on the SECT\nlength and handle them in the MPEG2 TS dissector in that case, rather than\nhanding them to the SECT dissector (which assumes that the incoming tvb\ncontains only one section and no additional data), similar to how stuffing\nbytes are already handled when the PUSI is 1.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2021-03-07T20:11:29.115Z",
  "updated_at": "2021-03-09T08:42:10.303Z",
