    {
      "id": "2d3dc5436fabd3c1bdc4fafb71da1ef26fe5f1ad",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 523909271,
          "type": null,
          "body": "[mpe_fragments.pcapng](/uploads/fa430e5078aa4f7e88bcd96074cb2ed5/mpe_fragments.pcapng) has some examples with MPE sections that appear in MPEG TS packets with the PUSI set to 0. Without this patch, too large packets are reassembled and too much is passed to dvb_data_mpe. The stuffing is included instead of being a separate field.",
